%%report product-created-per-month title: Products created per month entity: Product chart: line x: month y: records help: A sellable or serviceable catalogue item that gives assets, parts, warranties, and work instructions a consistent identity. New products per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_product WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
