%%report milestone-policy-first-response-minutes-per-month title: Average first response minutes per month entity: MilestonePolicy chart: line x: month y: average_first_response_minutes help: A reusable SLA clock definition for first response and resolution, including priority and permitted pauses. The average first response minutes of milestone policies created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(first_response_minutes)::numeric, 2) AS average_first_response_minutes FROM bus_milestone_policy WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
