%%report presence-status-capacity-percent-per-month title: Average capacity percent per month entity: PresenceStatus chart: line x: month y: average_capacity_percent help: A workforce availability state used by omnichannel routing, capacity, adherence, and occupancy reporting. The average capacity percent of presence statuses created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(capacity_percent)::numeric, 2) AS average_capacity_percent FROM bus_presence_status WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
