%%report case-participant-per-case title: Case Participants per case entity: CaseParticipant chart: bar x: case y: records help: A customer or workforce participant added to a case for collaboration, visibility, approval, or notifications. Which case the most case participants belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS case, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_case_participant x LEFT JOIN bus_case p ON p.id = x.case_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
