%%report case-milestone-by-status title: Case Milestones by status entity: CaseMilestone chart: pie x: status y: records help: A concrete SLA clock on one case, retaining its calculated deadline, pauses, completion, and breach outcome. How case milestones divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_case_milestone WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report case-milestone-by-milestone-type title: Case Milestones by milestone type entity: CaseMilestone chart: pie x: milestone_type y: records help: A concrete SLA clock on one case, retaining its calculated deadline, pauses, completion, and breach outcome. How case milestones divide across milestone type, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(milestone_type::text, '(unset)') AS milestone_type, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_case_milestone WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
