%%report skill-requirement-minimum-level-per-month title: Average minimum level per month entity: SkillRequirement chart: line x: month y: average_minimum_level help: A required or relaxable skill on routed work, including the minimum proficiency and the wait before the requirement may be dropped. The average minimum level of skill requirements created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(minimum_level)::numeric, 2) AS average_minimum_level FROM bus_skill_requirement WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report skill-requirement-drop-after-minutes-per-month title: Average drop after minutes per month entity: SkillRequirement chart: line x: month y: average_drop_after_minutes help: A required or relaxable skill on routed work, including the minimum proficiency and the wait before the requirement may be dropped. The average drop after minutes of skill requirements created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(drop_after_minutes)::numeric, 2) AS average_drop_after_minutes FROM bus_skill_requirement WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report skill-requirement-per-routing-configuration title: Skill Requirements per routing configuration entity: SkillRequirement chart: bar x: routing_configuration y: records help: A required or relaxable skill on routed work, including the minimum proficiency and the wait before the requirement may be dropped. Which routing configuration the most skill requirements belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS routing_configuration, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_skill_requirement x LEFT JOIN bus_routing_configuration p ON p.id = x.routing_configuration_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report service-resource-skill-skill-level-per-month title: Average skill level per month entity: ServiceResourceSkill chart: line x: month y: average_skill_level help: A verified technician capability with proficiency and expiry, used to prevent assignments that are unsafe or unqualified. The average skill level of service resource skills created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(skill_level)::numeric, 2) AS average_skill_level FROM bus_service_resource_skill WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
