%%report service-resource-skill-skill-level-per-service-resource title: Total skill level per service resource entity: ServiceResourceSkill chart: bar x: service_resource y: total_skill_level help: A verified technician capability with proficiency and expiry, used to prevent assignments that are unsafe or unqualified. Service Resource Skills added up on skill level for each service resource, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS service_resource, ROUND(SUM(x.skill_level)::numeric, 2) AS total_skill_level FROM bus_service_resource_skill x LEFT JOIN bus_service_resource p ON p.id = x.service_resource_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
